{"id":"8346a921772e7ddf","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-space-complexity-notation.md","title":"73-df-space-complexity-notation — space complexity notation","display":"73-df-space-complexity-notation — space complexity notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-space-complexity-notation","display":"73-df-space-complexity-notation — space complexity notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-deterministic-work-space]]","[[73-df-nondeterministic-work-space]]","[[73-df-exact-work-space-construction]]","[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]"],"aliases":["73-df-space-complexity-notation","73-definition-10.2"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-space-complexity-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-space-complexity-notation — space complexity notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1a769cdc24b3e236\" href=\"?note=1a769cdc24b3e236\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-work-space\">73-df-deterministic-work-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5487b1bca12f6c5f\" href=\"?note=5487b1bca12f6c5f\" title=\"73-df-nondeterministic-work-space\">73-df-nondeterministic-work-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cadee7248274622b\" href=\"?note=cadee7248274622b\" title=\"73-df-exact-work-space-construction\">73-df-exact-work-space-construction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-space-complexity-notation</span><span>73-definition-10.2</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\">\\(\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\\)</span>；工作机、只读输入、输入读头边界、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{space}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{space}_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1a769cdc24b3e236\" href=\"?note=1a769cdc24b3e236\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-work-space\">73-df-deterministic-work-space</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(S:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>；本资源上下文的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 为下述带只读输入的确定性工作机集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Space}(M,w)\">\\(\\mathrm{Space}(M,w)\\)</span> 是部分空间函数，发散不被当作零空间。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SpaceConstr}\">\\(\\mathrm{SpaceConstr}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cadee7248274622b\" href=\"?note=cadee7248274622b\" title=\"73-df-exact-work-space-construction\">73-df-exact-work-space-construction</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NSPACE},\\mathsf{coNSPACE}\">\\(\\mathsf{NSPACE},\\mathsf{coNSPACE}\\)</span> 的全部约束见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5487b1bca12f6c5f\" href=\"?note=5487b1bca12f6c5f\" title=\"73-df-nondeterministic-work-space\">73-df-nondeterministic-work-space</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SPACE}(S(n))\">\\(\\mathrm{SPACE}(S(n))\\)</span> 是以整个函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为参数的兼容写法。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为候选机器，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>；涉及某台机器代价的点值子句只在对应图含有该输入时调用。资源机全体若为类，则下面的图同样按有类型类缩写解释。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\land\\operatorname{ReadOnlyInput}(M)\\land\\operatorname{InputHeadBounded}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Space}\\coloneqq\\{((M,w),r):M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\land r\\in\\mathbb N\\land(w,r)\\in\\operatorname{space}_M\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{WorkMDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\land\\operatorname{ReadOnlyInput}(M)\\land\\operatorname{InputHeadBounded}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Space}\\coloneqq\\{((M,w),r):M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\land r\\in\\mathbb N\\land(w,r)\\in\\operatorname{space}_M\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SpaceBound}(M,S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land\\bigl(\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(((M,w),r)\\in\\mathrm{Space}\\land r\\le S(|w|))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SpaceBound}(M,S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land\\bigl(\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(((M,w),r)\\in\\mathrm{Space}\\land r\\le S(|w|))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Space}(M,\\cdot)\\in O(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;((M,w),r)\\in\\mathrm{Space}\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(|w|\\ge n_0\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;(((M,w),r)\\in\\mathrm{Space}\\land r\\le cS(|w|)))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Space}(M,\\cdot)\\in O(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;((M,w),r)\\in\\mathrm{Space}\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(|w|\\ge n_0\\to\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;(((M,w),r)\\in\\mathrm{Space}\\land r\\le cS(|w|)))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SPACE}(S)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;(L=L(M)\\land\\mathrm{Space}(M,\\cdot)\\in O(S))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SPACE}(S)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;(L=L(M)\\land\\mathrm{Space}(M,\\cdot)\\in O(S))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NSPACE}(S)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists N\\;\n(\\operatorname{WorkNTM}_{\\mathbf2}(N)\\land L=L(N)\\land\\operatorname{NReadOnlyInput}(N)\n\\land\\operatorname{NInputHeadBounded}_{\\mathbf2}(N)\\land\\operatorname{AllBranchesHalt}(N)\n\\land\\operatorname{NSpaceBound}(N,S))\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Co\\mathrm{}NSPACE}(S)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\mathbf2^*\\setminus L\\in\\mathrm{NSPACE}(S)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NSPACE}(S)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists N\\;\n(\\operatorname{WorkNTM}_{\\mathbf2}(N)\\land L=L(N)\\land\\operatorname{NReadOnlyInput}(N)\n\\land\\operatorname{NInputHeadBounded}_{\\mathbf2}(N)\\land\\operatorname{AllBranchesHalt}(N)\n\\land\\operatorname{NSpaceBound}(N,S))\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Co\\mathrm{}NSPACE}(S)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\mathbf2^*\\setminus L\\in\\mathrm{NSPACE}(S)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SpaceConstr}\\coloneqq\\{s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}:\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}(s)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.2}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SpaceConstr}\\coloneqq\\{s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}:\\operatorname{SpaceConstructible}(s)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-deterministic-work-space","status":"resolved","id":"1a769cdc24b3e236","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-deterministic-work-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nondeterministic-work-space","status":"resolved","id":"5487b1bca12f6c5f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nondeterministic-work-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-exact-work-space-construction","status":"resolved","id":"cadee7248274622b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-exact-work-space-construction]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":